%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e06240941985684099e5e2e5e2644a2, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 57801703424
    m_Localized: Circus Ringmaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616805875748864
    m_Localized: Clown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616805875752960
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57814286336
    m_Localized: <speed=60>Ah, welcome, traveler!</speed> <bold>You've arrived</bold>
      at this old circus theater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57826869248
    m_Localized: <shake a=6 s=40>Careful now!</shake> Something <wave>stirs</wave>
      beneath this stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57843646464
    m_Localized: Beneath the <rainbow s=2>dazzling lights</rainbow>, your fate will
      spin like a <round r=4 s=5>trapeze</round>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15614216484421632
    m_Localized: "<shake a=1>Where am I\u2026?</shake>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15614806379724800
    m_Localized: Ladies and gentlemen, <round>welcome</round> to the Circus of the
      Underworld!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615341296091136
    m_Localized: What delightful show awaits us tonight?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615405926121472
    m_Localized: Well then, let's go and see for ourselves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615554589032448
    m_Localized: (Cheerful yet unsettling circus music begins to play)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616805875757056
    m_Localized: "I think I came out of this mirror\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615680212631552
    m_Localized: "<shake>Why\u2026 did I come out of a mirror\u2026?</shake>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616805875761152
    m_Localized: "What's happening over there\u2026."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615758281211904
    m_Localized: (The curtain is drawn, so it's hard to see, but from behind it comes
      the endless laughter and singing of the audience, and the sounds of the troupe
      performing.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615827193626624
    m_Localized: "<shake>What on earth\u2026. is this place\u2026.?</shake>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15615916209340416
    m_Localized: (Just then, a loud <shake a=2>BANG!</shake> rings out from the stage
      beyond the curtain, followed by someone's scream. Yet not a single gasp comes
      from the audience. All that can be heard is jeering, roaring laughter, and
      applause.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616729136758784
    m_Localized: "(And so, the show seemed to end\u2026 without a hitch?)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616758543024128
    m_Localized: (I had no idea, not until the performers came backstage.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15616805875744768
    m_Localized: (Then a hulking man came backstage. The moment he entered, every
      performer's eyes filled with fear. He dragged the performer who seemed to have
      slipped up into the darkness and vanished. Only a dying scream came drifting
      out.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483213807026176
    m_Localized: (A pain as if my head would split open came rushing in.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483213853163520
    m_Localized: (When I opened my eyes, I was lying face down in an unfamiliar place.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483213890912256
    m_Localized: (Just then, a voice came from behind the curtain.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483213916078080
    m_Localized: (Then came a roar of cheers like thunder.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483213953826816
    m_Localized: (The mirror was cracked and shattered, as if struck with a blunt
      weapon.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483213995769856
    m_Localized: (I had no memory of why I came out of the mirror, or of what happened
      before I did.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17483214029324288
    m_Localized: (As if it had never existed in the first place.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691723616256
    m_Localized: Manager
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691744587776
    m_Localized: Knife Thrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691773947904
    m_Localized: "(All the performers wore masks, each their own. They never took
      them off, nor did the masks ever seem to bother them \u2014 as if they had
      always been their real faces.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691799113728
    m_Localized: Well met. You must be the new one who's come in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691815890944
    m_Localized: I'm sorry you had to see something like this right after you arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691836862464
    m_Localized: Pleased to meet you. I am the one who serves as manager here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691862028288
    m_Localized: (He introduced himself as the manager of this deranged circus.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691878805504
    m_Localized: (His way of speaking sounded as if he'd stepped out of some bygone
      era.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691899777024
    m_Localized: "Ah\u2026 I see\u2026. Where\u2026 where exactly is this\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691924942848
    m_Localized: (At those words, the manager began explaining, as if he'd been waiting
      for the question.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691950108672
    m_Localized: I suppose I ought to tell you where this place is, first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691971080192
    m_Localized: This is the underworld. The very underworld you know of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588691992051712
    m_Localized: (In that moment, I felt as if I'd been struck in the head with a
      hammer.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692008828928
    m_Localized: (I had no memory, yet I was clearly alive. I wanted to ask if he
      was joking, but I glanced down at the manager's feet and thought better of
      it.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692038189056
    m_Localized: "What's the matter? Ah\u2026. startled that you cast no shadow,
      were you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692063354880
    m_Localized: "(I looked down at my feet in a hurry. Strange \u2014 my shadow
      was right there, following me as if nothing had ever been wrong.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692084326400
    m_Localized: Startled, were you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692105297920
    m_Localized: (He went on explaining, as if it were nothing out of the ordinary.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692122075136
    m_Localized: This underworld, too, has day and night, just as the world of the
      living does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692143046656
    m_Localized: "(Day and night. Perhaps an obvious enough thing to say \u2014 and
      yet, for some reason, it sounds dangerous.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692168212480
    m_Localized: "But at night, you must be careful \u2014 the forgotten dead walk
      freely."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692189184000
    m_Localized: Those things crave something called memory shards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692210155520
    m_Localized: "(Memory shards. From his explanation, they were like blank pages
      \u2014 nothing written on them at all. But when a soul makes contact with one,
      the memories buried at that soul's core take shape and are inscribed onto the
      shard.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692239515648
    m_Localized: (A memory given shape this way can be touched by others, who may
      then glimpse into it.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692256292864
    m_Localized: "(But if it is not a pure soul that makes contact with the shard
      \u2014 if it is one of the forgotten dead \u2014 the shard becomes as if soaked
      in ink, unable to write down any memory at all.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692277264384
    m_Localized: And memory shards, they say, are found only in the Reverse World.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692302430208
    m_Localized: "The\u2026 Reverse World\u2026.?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692327596032
    m_Localized: "The underside of the underworld\u2026\u2026 a place you might call
      the disposal grounds for souls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692348567552
    m_Localized: "Souls who've lingered too long in the underworld and lost their
      sense of self, or wretched souls on the verge of fading away \u2014 every last
      one of them gets cast down there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692373733376
    m_Localized: (The manager gave a light tap to a cold, shattered shard of mirror
      hanging on the tent wall.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692394704896
    m_Localized: What's cast down there has already lost its reason. The moment it
      sees a living soul, or a whole memory shard, it'll lunge like a starving beast
      and try to tear it apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692411482112
    m_Localized: "Should you ever set foot in that place\u2026\u2026 you'll have
      to fight for your life against hideous monsters that never stop coming."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692440842240
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692461813760
    m_Localized: (Disposal grounds, swarming with souls on the verge of fading.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692482785280
    m_Localized: (Just imagining it sent a chill crawling over my whole body.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692512145408
    m_Localized: (He turned to leave.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692528922624
    m_Localized: "(Thud\u2026 thud\u2026 thud\u2026)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692554088448
    m_Localized: (And then he stopped.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692579254272
    m_Localized: "And\u2026 you are not a being who ought to be here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692604420096
    m_Localized: (With those words, he left.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692629585920
    m_Localized: (Once he was gone, I fell into even greater confusion.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692654751744
    m_Localized: "Not a being who\u2026 ought to be here\u2026.?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692675723264
    m_Localized: (This is the underworld. A place the dead are meant to come to.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692700889088
    m_Localized: "(But he told me I was a being who shouldn't be here. Which meant\u2026.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692721860608
    m_Localized: (I hadn't come here by dying.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692742832128
    m_Localized: Hey, you there! Give me a hand for a second?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692767997952
    m_Localized: (Just as my thoughts were reaching their end, a cheerful voice grabbed
      my hand and dragged me off somewhere.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692788969472
    m_Localized: H-hey, wait! What are you doing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692809940992
    m_Localized: It'll only take a second~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692830912512
    m_Localized: "(My hand was caught in her grip, being pulled along. And yet her
      hand was cold as ice \u2014 that chill was what finally shook me back into
      reality.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692856078336
    m_Localized: (When I came to my senses, I was bound fast in front of a target
      board. And on top of my head sat a single apple.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692881244160
    m_Localized: Wh-what are you trying to do?! Untie this!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692906409984
    m_Localized: I told you, it'll only take a second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692927381504
    m_Localized: (She stepped back a good distance and drew out a knife.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692944158720
    m_Localized: Don't move or you'll get hurt~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692965130240
    m_Localized: (Almost before she'd finished speaking, she threw the knife. In
      an instant it struck the wall right beside my face. In that moment, my legs
      went weak, and I couldn't even think of struggling.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588692990296064
    m_Localized: "That was a close one. Now\u2026 let's try again!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693015461888
    m_Localized: (The next knife struck true, right into the apple perched on top
      of my head.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693036433408
    m_Localized: (The apple dropped to the floor.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693061599232
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026am I alive?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693082570752
    m_Localized: Ha! Nailed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693103542272
    m_Localized: (She got up from her spot as if it were nothing at all, and came
      over to me.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693128708096
    m_Localized: (Then she untied the rope that had been binding me.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693153873920
    m_Localized: What on earth are you doing?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693170651136
    m_Localized: What do you think? Rehearsing for the show.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693195816960
    m_Localized: "You call that rehearsing \u2014 tying someone up and throwing knives
      at them?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693220982784
    m_Localized: I hit the mark dead center, didn't I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693237760000
    m_Localized: That's not the point here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693258731520
    m_Localized: (She looked at me for a moment, then let out a small, amused laugh.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693279703040
    m_Localized: Loud voice for someone who just got here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693300674560
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026what?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693313257472
    m_Localized: This is your first time here, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693342617600
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026yeah."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693359394816
    m_Localized: Then you don't know a single thing yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693384560640
    m_Localized: (She spun the knife in her hand once, then tucked it away.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693401337856
    m_Localized: I'm the Knife Thrower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693422309376
    m_Localized: I'm the one who handles the knife-throwing act in this circus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693447475200
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026that's a job here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693464252416
    m_Localized: It is, in this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693489418240
    m_Localized: (She looked around at her surroundings.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693502001152
    m_Localized: This isn't an ordinary place, you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693527166976
    m_Localized: (A brief silence.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693543944192
    m_Localized: And starting today, you're one of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693573304320
    m_Localized: Wait a second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693590081536
    m_Localized: I never said I'd agree to that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693611053056
    m_Localized: You'll have to take that up with the Master.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693632024576
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693648801792
    m_Localized: (The moment I heard those words, the image of the performer being
      dragged into the darkness earlier came flooding back.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693673967616
    m_Localized: (I couldn't say another word.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693690744832
    m_Localized: No need to be scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693711716352
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026I'm not scared."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693736882176
    m_Localized: Liar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693757853696
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693778825216
    m_Localized: Well, you'll get used to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693803991040
    m_Localized: (She held out a single knife.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693820768256
    m_Localized: What's this for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693841739776
    m_Localized: It's not for you to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693862711296
    m_Localized: But remember this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693879488512
    m_Localized: If you want to survive here, watching others isn't enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693904654336
    m_Localized: (She twirled the knife between her fingers.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693921431552
    m_Localized: You have to learn it firsthand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693942403072
    m_Localized: (At that moment, a faint light began to glow from the tip of the
      knife.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693967568896
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026what is this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588693988540416
    m_Localized: Something like a survival skill you can learn from me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588694009511936
    m_Localized: (The Knife Thrower throws the knife.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588694030483456
    m_Localized: (The knife cuts through the air and buries itself in the wall.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588694055649280
    m_Localized: "Its name is\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17588694076620800
    m_Localized: <bold>Broken Phantasm.</bold>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701244223488
    m_Localized: Clown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701273583616
    m_Localized: Juggler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701290360832
    m_Localized: Hey there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701307138048
    m_Localized: Hello!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701328109568
    m_Localized: What's your role in the circus?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701349081088
    m_Localized: I can perform tricks with balls! Want me to show you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701370052608
    m_Localized: (As soon as he spoke, the Juggler threw a ball at the wall.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701391024128
    m_Localized: (The ball bounced a few times, then suddenly burst with a bang...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17621701407801344
